-- CONDITION WITHOUT AN ELSE ------------------------------------ main.kl  K0731

This `if` is used as a value, so it needs a `else` branch: without one, there is no value when the condition is false.

10│     let label = if 5 > 0: "positive"
                    ^^

Help: Add a `else:` branch with the value for the false case, or use the `if` as a statement on its own line.

Learn more: kalam explain K0731
